  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Use tokens to represent drones. They have no effect as models. Guardian Drone: For ranged attacks made against the bearer’s unit, modify the Wound roll by −1. Gun Drone: give the bearer a twin pulse carbine with [ASSAULT] and [TWIN-LINKED] (Range 20″, A 2, BS 5+, S 5, AP 0, D 1). Marker Drone: give the bearer’s unit MARKERLIGHT and allow it to act as an Observer after it Advances that turn. Missile Drone: equip the bearer with a missile pod (Range 30″, A 2, BS 5+, S 7, AP −1, D 2). Shield Drone: increase the bearer’s Wounds by 1.",
